    <briefdescription>
<para>A read-only multiline textbox widget for logging messages. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a simple logging panel with a non-editable, line-wrapped, and multi-line textbox. It allows appending messages and clearing the log content. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
